
---
---

<section class="process-section" id="proceso">
  <div class="process-inner">
    <div class="process-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> EL MÉTODO</span>
      <h2>
        No instalamos tecnología<br />
        <span>por instalarla.</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Primero entendemos cómo funciona tu negocio. Después encontramos
        dónde la tecnología puede hacer una diferencia real.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-list">
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span>01</span>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-label">DIAGNÓSTICO</span>
          <h3>Entendemos tu operación.</h3>
          <p>
            Analizamos cómo trabajas, qué tareas consumen tiempo y dónde
            se pierden oportunidades. Sin soluciones genéricas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-visual visual-one">
          <div class="scan-ring"></div>
          <div class="scan-center">
            <span>01</span>
            <small>ANALIZAR</small>
          </div>
          <span class="scan-tag tag-a">PROCESOS</span>
          <span class="scan-tag tag-b">OPORTUNIDADES</span>
          <span class="scan-tag tag-c">OBJETIVOS</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span>02</span>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-label">IMPLEMENTACIÓN</span>
          <h3>Diseñamos el sistema.</h3>
          <p>
            Seleccionamos las herramientas adecuadas y construimos un flujo
            de trabajo que se adapte a tu negocio, no al revés.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-visual visual-two">
          <div class="flow-node node-a">
            <span class="node-icon">01</span>
            <small>ENTRADA</small>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-connector"></div>
          <div class="flow-node node-b">
            <span class="node-icon">✳</span>
            <small>SISTEMA</small>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-connector"></div>
          <div class="flow-node node-c">
            <span class="node-icon">✓</span>
            <small>ACCIÓN</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span>03</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-label">OPTIMIZACIÓN</span>
          <h3>Medimos y mejoramos.</h3>
          <p>
            Probamos el funcionamiento, corregimos lo necesario y ajustamos
            el sistema conforme evoluciona tu operación.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-visual visual-three">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-top">
              <span>RENDIMIENTO</span>
              <span class="metric-live">● ENFOQUE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-bars">
              <i style="height: 32%"></i>
              <i style="height: 48%"></i>
              <i style="height: 42%"></i>
              <i style="height: 68%"></i>
              <i style="height: 59%"></i>
              <i style="height: 82%"></i>
              <i style="height: 100%"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-bottom">
              <span>MEDIR</span>
              <span>AJUSTAR</span>
              <span>MEJORAR</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="process-footer">
      <span class="footer-symbol">✳</span>
      <p>La tecnología debe adaptarse a tu negocio. No tu negocio a la tecnología.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 130px 24px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 5% 45%, rgba(116, 67, 255, .09), transparent 38%),
      #08080d;
    color: #f4f2fa;
  }

  .process-inner {
    width: min(1120px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .process-heading {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-bottom: 76px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: #aaa3bd;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .19em;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #a58aff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #916cff;
  }

  .process-heading h2 {
    margin: 22px 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 66px);
    line-height: .99;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .process-heading h2 span {
    color: #8d72ed;
  }

  .process-heading > p {
    max-width: 490px;
    color: #9693a3;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .process-list {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  }

  .process-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr 340px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 35px;
    min-height: 260px;
    padding: 34px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  }

  .step-index {
    align-self: stretch;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-index > span {
    color: #a58aff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .step-line {
    width: 1px;
    flex: 1;
    margin: 20px 0 0 5px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(165,138,255,.45), transparent);
  }

  .step-label {
    color: #8e7bc8;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    margin: 13px 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 3vw, 32px);
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
  }

  .step-content p {
    max-width: 430px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #9693a3;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .step-visual {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 185px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    border-radius: 15px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.035), rgba(255,255,255,.008));
  }

  .visual-one {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 25px 25px;
  }

  .scan-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(154,124,255,.35);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(130,90,255,.12), inset 0 0 30px rgba(130,90,255,.08);
  }

  .scan-ring::before,
  .scan-ring::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 13px;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(154,124,255,.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .scan-ring::after {
    inset: 28px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: rgba(90,220,255,.3);
  }

  .scan-center {
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .scan-center span {
    color: #d7ccff;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .scan-center small,
  .scan-tag {
    color: #a99bcf;
    font-size: 8px;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .scan-tag {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(165,138,255,.2);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #11101b;
  }

  .tag-a { top: 25px; left: 20px; }
  .tag-b { right: 15px; top: 75px; }
  .tag-c { bottom: 23px; left: 35px; }

  .visual-two {
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 15px;
  }

  .flow-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 9px;
    width: 82px;
    height: 85px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(165,138,255,.23);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(120,90,220,.08);
  }

  .node-icon {
    color: #c5b5ff;
    font-size: 21px;
  }

  .flow-node small {
    color: #aaa3bd;
    font-size: 8px;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .node-b {
    border-color: rgba(75,215,255,.35);
    background: rgba(75,215,255,.06);
  }

  .node-b .node-icon { color: #71dcff; }
  .node-c .node-icon { color: #a5e8cb; }

  .flow-connector {
    width: 17px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8d72ed, #57d9ff);
  }

  .metric-card {
    width: 85%;
    padding: 17px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(9,9,15,.6);
  }

  .metric-top,
  .metric-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #aaa3bd;
    font-size: 8px;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .metric-live { color: #8bdcbb; }

  .metric-bars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 9px;
    height: 75px;
    margin: 15px 0 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  }

  .metric-bars i {
    flex: 1;
    border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(126,91,231,.35), #9a83ff);
  }

  .metric-bars i:nth-child(2n) {
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(58,180,220,.25), #59d8ee);
  }

  .metric-bottom { font-size: 7px; }

  .process-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .footer-symbol {
    color: #a58aff;
    font-size: 23px;
  }

  .process-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #aaa3bd;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .process-section { padding: 90px 22px; }
    .process-heading { margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .process-step {
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 28px 0;
    }
    .step-visual {
      grid-column: 2;
      min-height: 155px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .step-index { grid-row: span 2; }
    .step-content p { font-size: 12px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .process-section { padding: 75px 18px; }
    .process-heading h2 { font-size: 39px; }
    .step-visual { min-height: 140px; }
    .flow-node { width: 72px; height: 76px; }
    .flow-connector { width: 10px; }
    .scan-tag { font-size: 7px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      animation: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
